Raw_copies/agent.system.tool.wait.md.preview:
### wait
pause execution for a set time or until a timestamp
use args "seconds" "minutes" "hours" "days" for duration
use "until" with ISO timestamp for a specific time
usage:

1 wait duration
~~~json
{
 "thoughts": [
 "I need to wait..."
 ],
 "headline": "...",
 "tool_name": "wait",
 "tool_args": { 
 "minutes": 1, 
 "seconds": 30 
 }
}
~~~

2 wait timestamp
~~~json
{
 "thoughts": [
 "I will wait until..."
 ],
 "headline": "...",
 "tool_name": "wait",
 "tool_args": { 
 "until": "2025-10-20T10:00:00Z" 
 }
}
~~~

